Z||000000||BOILERMAKER||08-20-2000||08:05 PM||||For those of you keeping track, I just got done re-installing the gold car's engine.  Boy, this is becoming second nature to me now.<P>Thank goodness that this engine had never been out before (well, besides wrestling with some of the stuck bolts).  It was quite interesting to see some of the ORIGINAL placements of some of the harnesses, original bolts used, ... etc.<P>The reason for taking the engine out in the first place was due to a cracked exhaust manifold (almost 360 degrees around), 2 broken exhaust manifold bolts (never touched them before this past weekend and didn't break them off myself) and a huge crack in my cat.<P>It's all done now and has been driven on a road trip to prove it's worthy.  What a week!!!!!!<P>------------------<BR>Mike<BR>86 Black 3.1 GT<BR>87 Gold GT||||reg||1
